<template><view class="partner-center"><text v-if="loading" class="hint">正在更新拿货资格与价格…</text><view v-if="error" class="white-card"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="ui-button" @click="load">重新加载</button></view><template v-else><view class="white-card partner-summary">
 <text class="product-title">专属拿货</text>
 <template v-if="summary">
  <view class="partner-status"><text class="partner-current">{{summary.title}}</text><text v-if="summary.badge" class="source-badge">{{summary.badge}}</text></view>
  <view v-if="summary.feeText||summary.nextText" class="partner-spend"><text v-if="summary.feeText" class="spend-amount">{{summary.feeText}}</text><text v-if="summary.nextText" class="hint">{{summary.nextText}}</text></view>
  <text v-for="line in summary.lines" :key="line" class="hint">{{line}}</text>
  <view v-if="commissionSummary" class="commission-line"><text class="commission-text">{{commissionSummary}}</text><text v-if="commissionNote" class="hint">{{commissionNote}}</text></view>
  <view v-if="summary.ladder.length&&summary.kind!=='blocked'" class="partner-rule-list">
   <text class="ladder-title">{{summary.kind==='manual'?'按加盟款自动定折扣的标准（你当前由商家指定）':'拿货折扣按累计已登记加盟款确定'}}</text>
   <view v-for="row in summary.ladder" :key="row.level" :class="{current:row.level===summary.currentLevel}"><text class="rule-rate">{{row.rateText}}</text><text>累计加盟款满 {{row.thresholdText}}<text v-if="showLadderCommission&&row.commissionText"> · {{row.commissionText}}</text><text v-if="row.level===summary.currentLevel" class="current-tag"> · 当前档位</text></text></view>
  </view>
  <text class="hint">同一个微信账号，零售和拿货分开购买。只有从本页下单，才使用拿货价。</text>
  <button v-if="summary.showApply" class="ui-button primary" @click="go('distribution')">{{data.profile.applicationState==='pending'?'查看分销申请进度':data.profile.applicationState==='rejected'?'完善分销申请':'申请成为分销商'}}</button>
 </template>
 <button class="ui-button retail-entry" @click="go('category')">去零售商城</button>
</view>
<view class="white-card purchase-guide"><text class="product-title">零售、拿货与推广</text><text class="hint">零售商城按商品零售价销售，会员等级和拿货资格都不改变零售价；充值达到优惠档位的客户按自己的充值折扣价购买，还可同时使用优惠券、满减和积分。</text><text class="hint">专属拿货按商品零售价 × 你的拿货折扣结算，只能从本页单独下单，用微信付款，也可以用门店余额抵扣；不能使用优惠券、积分、活动和小程序充值余额，拿货订单也不送消费积分。</text><text v-if="data.profile.distributor" class="hint">推广收益：客户通过你的分享购买零售商品，按客户实付的商品金额（不含运费）计算佣金。商家单独设置的比例优先；能拿货时按拿货档位自动确定，拿货折扣越低佣金越高（例如 2.2折 拿客户实付的 78%，最高 90%）；不能拿货时按卖出奖励规则。结算时间以分销中心显示为准。</text></view><view v-if="data.profile.tier===3" class="white-card"><text class="product-title">分销推广</text><text class="hint">分销审核通过后，可分享商品并在分销中心查看推广业绩和佣金；新分销商仍需自行申请并通过审核。</text><button class="ui-button" @click="go('distribution')">进入分销中心 / 邀请分销员</button></view><view class="modes"><button class="ui-button" :class="{active:tab==='shop'}" @click="tab='shop'">专属拿货</button><button class="ui-button" :class="{active:tab==='assistant'}" @click="tab='assistant'">助手账号</button><button class="ui-button" :class="{active:tab==='dashboard'}" v-if="data.profile.tier===3||data.assisting.length" @click="showDashboard">合伙人工作台</button></view><template v-if="tab==='shop'&&data.profile.enabled"><view class="white-card"><input class="partner-input" v-model="keyword" placeholder="搜索拿货商品"/><text class="hint">拿货商品单独结算，用微信付款，也可以用门店余额抵扣；不能使用优惠券、积分、活动和小程序充值余额，拿货订单也不送消费积分。</text></view><view v-for="p in shown" :key="p.id" class="white-card goods"><image :src="asset(p.image)" mode="aspectFit"/><view><text>{{p.name}} {{p.spec}}</text><text class="block price">拿货价 ¥{{money(p.price)}}</text><text class="hint">标准零售价 ¥{{money(p.standardPrice)}} · 可售{{p.stock}}件{{soldCountText(p.soldCount)?' · '+soldCountText(p.soldCount):''}}</text><view class="qty"><button class="ui-button" @click="setQty(p.id,Math.max(0,(quantities[p.id]||0)-1))">－</button><input type="number" :value="quantities[p.id]||0" @input="setQty(p.id,$event.detail.value)"/><button class="ui-button" @click="setQty(p.id,(quantities[p.id]||0)+1)">＋</button></view></view></view><button class="ui-button" v-if="visible<filtered.length" @click="visible+=20">查看更多商品</button><view v-if="unavailableIds.length" class="white-card"><text class="hint">部分已选商品已下架或暂不支持拿货，请移除后再结算。</text><button class="ui-button" :disabled="loading||busy" @click="clearUnavailable">移除失效商品</button></view><view class="white-card"><text>已选{{selected.length}}种 · 商品合计 ¥{{money(total)}}</text><button class="ui-button primary" :disabled="loading||busy||!!error||!selected.length||!!unavailableIds.length" @click="checkout">确认专属拿货清单</button></view></template><template v-if="tab==='assistant'"><ReferralCodeCard :member="member"/><view class="white-card assistant-owner"><text class="product-title">我的助手邀请码</text><template v-if="canInvite"><text class="hint">邀请一位员工查看授权订单和推广业绩，仅可查看，不能代你下单或提现。</text><view v-if="myAssistant?.member_id" class="assistant-connected"><text>已关联助手：{{myAssistant.username||'微信账号'}}</text><text class="hint">需要更换助手时，请先解除关联。</text></view><template v-else><view v-if="inviteText" class="assistant-code-box"><text class="code-caption">将此码发给你的助手</text><text selectable class="assistant-code">{{inviteText}}</text><button class="ui-button primary" :disabled="busy||loading" @click="copyInvite">复制助手邀请码</button></view><text v-if="myAssistant?.expires_at" class="hint">邀请有效至 {{formatDate(myAssistant.expires_at)}}。未保存时可重新生成，旧邀请码将失效。</text><button class="ui-button primary" :disabled="busy||loading" @click="invite">{{myAssistant?'重新生成助手邀请码':'生成助手邀请码'}}</button></template><button v-if="myAssistant" class="ui-button invite-secondary" :disabled="busy||loading" @click="revoke">{{myAssistant.member_id?'解除助手关联':'撤销本次邀请'}}</button></template><template v-else><text class="hint">当前身份：{{data.profile.enabled&&data.profile.name||'商城会员'}}。最高档{{topTierName?'「'+topTierName+'」':''}}拿货商可生成助手邀请码；当前账号可接受其他合伙人的邀请。</text><text class="hint">推广邀请码用于邀请客户或伙伴，不能填写在下方助手邀请框中。</text></template></view><view class="white-card assistant-invite"><text class="invite-title">接受合伙人助手邀请</text><text class="hint">粘贴合伙人提供的邀请码，开通只读查看权限。</text><input class="partner-input" v-model="token" maxlength="160" placeholder="粘贴助手邀请码" placeholder-class="partner-placeholder"/><button class="ui-button primary" :disabled="busy" @click="accept">确认接受只读助手权限</button><text v-for="a in data.assisting" :key="a.owner_id" class="hint">已关联：{{a.nickname}}，仅查看已授权业务。</text></view></template><view v-if="tab==='dashboard'&&dashboard" class="white-card"><text class="product-title">{{dashboard.readOnly?'助手只读工作台':'合伙人工作台'}}</text><text class="hint">仅显示主账号订单简表及推广业绩，不提供客户地址、证件或收款信息。</text><text class="block">订单{{dashboard.orders.length}}笔 · 推广佣金 ¥{{money(dashboard.rewards.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.amount,0))}}</text><view v-for="o in dashboard.orders.slice(0,dashboardVisible)" :key="o.order_no" class="record"><text>{{o.order_no}}</text><text class="block">{{types[o.business_type]||'历史订单'}} · {{labels[o.status]||o.status}} · ¥{{money(o.amount)}}</text></view><button class="ui-button" v-if="dashboardVisible<dashboard.orders.length" @click="dashboardVisible+=30">查看更多订单</button><view v-for="r in dashboard.rewards.slice(0,rewardVisible)" :key="r.order_no+'_'+r.depth" class="record"><text>{{r.order_no}}</text><text class="block">第{{r.depth}}级奖励 ¥{{money(r.amount)}} · 可提现 ¥{{money(r.available_amount)}}</text></view><button class="ui-button" v-if="rewardVisible<dashboard.rewards.length" @click="rewardVisible+=30">查看更多推广记录</button></view></template></view></template>
<script>
import ReferralCodeCard from './ReferralCodeCard.vue'
import {assistantInvitation} from '../services/invitations'
import {formatDate} from '../services/display'
import {refreshOnTick} from '../services/panel-refresh'
import {partnerTierSummary,retailCommissionSummary,retailCommissionNote} from '../services/partner-tier'
import {soldCountText} from '../services/sold-count'
import {request,asset,money,go,notify,labels,getToken} from '../services/shop'
export default {
 components:{ReferralCodeCard},mixins:[refreshOnTick()],props:{member:{type:Object,default:null},query:{type:Object,default:()=>({})}},
 data(){return {data:{profile:{},products:[],assistant:[],assisting:[]},error:'',busy:false,loading:false,loadSequence:0,loadedOwner:null,tab:'shop',quantities:{},keyword:'',visible:20,token:'',inviteText:'',dashboard:null,dashboardVisible:30,rewardVisible:30,labels,types:{partner:'专属拿货',retail:'零售',enterprise:'历史企业采购'}}},
 computed:{summary(){return this.loadedOwner==null?null:partnerTierSummary(this.data.profile)},commissionSummary(){return this.data.profile.distributor?retailCommissionSummary(this.data.retailCommission):''},commissionNote(){return this.data.profile.distributor?retailCommissionNote(this.data.retailCommission):''},showLadderCommission(){return this.data.retailCommission?.source!=='member'},topTierName(){const tiers=this.data.profile.tiers;return Array.isArray(tiers)?String(tiers[tiers.length-1]?.name||''):''},canInvite(){return this.data.profile.enabled&&Number(this.data.profile.tier)===3},myAssistant(){return this.data.assistant[0]||null},filtered(){return this.data.products.filter(p=>(p.name+p.spec).includes(this.keyword.trim()))},shown(){return this.filtered.slice(0,this.visible)},selected(){return this.data.products.filter(p=>this.quantities[p.id]>0).map(p=>({...p,quantity:Number(this.quantities[p.id])}))},unavailableIds(){return Object.keys(this.quantities).filter(id=>this.quantities[id]>0&&!this.data.products.some(p=>String(p.id)===id))},total(){return this.selected.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.price*p.quantity,0)}},
 mounted(){this.token=this.query.assistantInvite||'';if(this.token)this.tab='assistant';this.load()},
 methods:{soldCountText,asset,money,go,formatDate,
  async load(){const sequence=++this.loadSequence,owner=uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner'),token=getToken();this.loading=true;this.error='';try{const data=await request('/partner');if(this._panelRefreshDisposed||sequence!==this.loadSequence||token!==getToken()||String(owner)!==String(uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')))return;if(String(this.loadedOwner)!==String(owner)||!(data.profile.enabled&&Number(data.profile.tier)===3)||data.assistant[0]?.member_id)this.inviteText='';this.data=data;this.loadedOwner=owner;this.quantities=uni.getStorageSync(this.key())||{};if(!(data.profile.enabled&&data.profile.tier===3)&&!data.assisting.length){this.dashboard=null;if(this.tab==='dashboard')this.tab='shop'}}catch(e){if(sequence===this.loadSequence)this.error=e.message}finally{if(sequence===this.loadSequence)this.loading=false}},
  key(){return 'shop-partner-list-'+uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')},
  setQty(id,v){if(this.loadedOwner!=null&&String(this.loadedOwner)!==String(uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')))return notify('登录状态已变更，请刷新后重试');const n=Number(v);this.quantities={...this.quantities,[id]:Number.isFinite(n)?Math.max(0,Math.min(10000,Math.floor(n))):0};uni.setStorageSync(this.key(),this.quantities)},
  clearUnavailable(){if(this.loading||this.busy)return;const next={...this.quantities};for(const id of this.unavailableIds)delete next[id];this.quantities=next;uni.setStorageSync(this.key(),next)},
  checkout(){if(this.loading||this.busy)return notify('正在更新拿货信息，请稍候');if(this.error||!this.data.profile.enabled||String(this.loadedOwner)!==String(uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')))return notify('请先刷新并确认当前拿货资格');if(this.unavailableIds.length)return notify('请先移除失效商品');if(!this.selected.length)return notify('请先选择拿货商品');if(this.selected.some(p=>p.quantity>p.stock))return notify('所选数量超过可售库存，请调整');uni.setStorageSync('shop-cart-'+uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')+'-checkout',{channel:'C',checkoutSource:'partner',purchaseMode:'partner',items:this.selected,requestKey:'partner_'+Date.now()+'_'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,9)});go('checkout')},
  async act(fn){if(this.busy)return;this.busy=true;try{await fn();await this.load()}catch(e){notify(e)}finally{this.busy=false}},
  invite(){if(this.busy||this.loading||!this.canInvite)return;const generate=()=>this.act(async()=>{const owner=this.loadedOwner,token=getToken();const r=await request('/partner/assistant/invite','POST',{});if(token===getToken()&&String(owner)===String(uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')))this.inviteText=r.token});if(this.myAssistant)uni.showModal({title:'重新生成助手邀请码',content:'重新生成后旧邀请码立即失效，请把新码交给助手。',success:r=>{if(r.confirm)generate()}});else generate()},copyInvite(){if(this.inviteText&&this.canInvite&&String(this.loadedOwner)===String(uni.getStorageSync('shop-owner')))uni.setClipboardData({data:this.inviteText})},revoke(){uni.showModal({title:'解除助手权限',content:'解除后，原助手立即不能查看你的业务。',success:r=>{if(r.confirm)this.act(async()=>{await request('/partner/assistant/revoke','POST',{});this.inviteText=''})}})},accept(){this.act(async()=>{await request('/partner/assistant/accept','POST',{token:assistantInvitation(this.token)});this.token='';notify('已接受助手权限')})},async showDashboard(){try{this.dashboard=await request('/partner/dashboard');this.tab='dashboard'}catch(e){notify(e)}}
 }
}
</script><style scoped>
@import '../styles/component-base.css';

.partner-center{padding:12px;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:15px;color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f)}.white-card{box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--shop-surface, #fdfeff);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee);min-width:0}.block,.hint{display:block}.hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--shop-muted, #59727f);line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.product-title{display:block;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:5px}.partner-summary>.block{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.modes{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;margin:16px 0;background:var(--shop-soft, #eaf5fb);border-radius:10px}.modes button{flex:1;min-width:0;margin:0;padding:12px 3px;line-height:1.4;font-size:15px;color:var(--shop-muted, #59727f);background:transparent;border-radius:7px}.modes button.active{background:var(--shop-surface, #fdfeff);color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f);font-weight:600;box-shadow:0 2px 6px #18341e0a}button::after{border:0}.goods{display:flex;gap:15px}.goods image{width:90px;height:110px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:8px}.goods>view{flex:1;min-width:0}.price{color:#885934;margin:8px 0}.partner-input{box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:100%;height:50px;min-height:50px;line-height:50px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee);border-radius:8px;font-size:16px;background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f)}.partner-placeholder{font-size:16px;color:var(--shop-muted, #59727f)}.assistant-invite .partner-input{text-align:center}.invite-title{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.assistant-invite>.hint{text-align:center;margin:8px 0 18px}.qty{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.qty button{flex-shrink:0;margin:0;width:34px;height:36px;line-height:36px;padding:0;font-size:18px;background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c);border-radius:6px}.qty input{box-sizing:border-box;width:64px;height:36px;min-height:36px;line-height:36px;text-align:center;font-size:15px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee);border-radius:6px}.primary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;line-height:1.5;padding:12px;font-size:16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--shop-accent, #c7e8f5);color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c);margin-top:16px}.record{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee);font-size:13px}
.assistant-code-box{margin:14px 0;padding:16px;background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);border-radius:9px}.code-caption{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--shop-muted, #59727f)}.assistant-code{display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:10px}.invite-secondary{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;padding:12px;background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c);border-radius:8px;margin-top:12px}.assistant-connected{font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}
.partner-current{display:block;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f);margin-top:12px}.partner-rule-list{margin:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee)}.partner-rule-list>view{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--shop-border, #d5e6ee);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.rule-rate{flex-shrink:0;width:58px;font-size:21px;font-weight:600;color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f)}.partner-rule-list>view>text:last-child{flex:1;min-width:0}.partner-spend{padding:16px;background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);border-radius:12px;font-size:14px}.spend-amount{display:block;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px}.purchase-guide .hint{line-height:1.8}.retail-entry{margin-top:14px}
.partner-status{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 10px;margin-top:12px}.partner-status .partner-current{margin-top:0;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.source-badge{flex-shrink:0;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--shop-soft, #eaf5fb);color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.partner-spend{margin-top:14px}.partner-spend .spend-amount{margin-top:0;font-size:20px}.partner-spend .hint{margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c)}.ladder-title{display:block;padding:12px 0 2px;font-size:13px;color:var(--shop-muted, #59727f);line-height:1.7}.partner-rule-list>view.current{background:var(--shop-background, #f3f8fb);margin:0 -10px;padding:14px 10px;border-radius:8px}.current-tag{color:var(--shop-text, #2b424f);font-weight:600}.commission-line{margin:14px 0 4px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--shop-soft, #eaf5fb);border-radius:10px}.commission-text{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.7;color:var(--shop-ink, #28546c);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.commission-line .hint{margin:4px 0 0}</style>
